[node name="LooksBackpackVacuum" type="Node3D" unique_id=1081160326]
editor_description = "assets/25: the Backpack vacuum's Looks (docs/architecture/devices.md \"Looks contracts\"). Front +Z, the origin on the floor under the tank's axis; worn, the origin sits 0.52 m up and 0.43 m behind the wearer's feet, unturned (the old WORN_AT), the back plate against their back. The lying clip shows the loose shoulder straps and the nozzle in its clips; worn shows the strap hoops round the wearer and takes the nozzle out of its clips (hidden here: the wearer holds it). The fill clip, seeked to the Tank's share (0 to 1 s), turns the dial's needle 120 degrees."

